  (7.5/3/7000.00/9500.50/250.00 and blanks) and that the body never contains
  `<no value>` or `&lt;no value&gt;`. `go test ./internal/handlers/whatif -run Spending -v -count=1`
  → all green (full output reviewed).

(e) Live end-to-end on scratch server + copied demo data (`BUDGET_LISTEN_ADDR=:8092`,
  data copied from ~/bin/ai/budget2-demo/data, no flags):
  - optimize (floor=3000, shortfall=7.5, near_term=3, min=7000/step first run,
